**Focus and Mental Clarity**Using palo santo during meditation or work sessions can improve concentration and mental clarity.

**Emotional Balance**Regular cleansing rituals may support emotional grounding and mindfulness.

These advantages explain why the benefits of palo santo sticks continue to attract people interested in wellness and spiritual growth.

